/P 54 0 R
/T (The case study demonstrated the major limitations that can arise when low-code platforms are applied to complex enterprise requirements, namely performance and scalability, complex business logic, system integration, customisation, security and governance, AI and advanced technology, vendor or platform dependency, and data management. It also showed how a hybrid low-code/pro-code approach can address requirements beyond standard low-code capabilities.)
/E (The case study demonstrated the major limitations that can arise when low-code platforms are applied to complex enterprise requirements, namely performance and scalability, complex business logic, system integration, customisation, security and governance, AI and advanced technology, vendor or platform dependency, and data management. It also showed how a hybrid low-code/pro-code approach can address requirements beyond standard low-code capabilities.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
