/Title (Low-code platforms offer speed and simplicity for standard business applications, but their limitations become more significant as enterprise complexity increases. For an application such as the Enterprise Student Admission Management System, standard functionality can be built quickly using low-code, while demanding requirements in logic, integration, security, scale and advanced technology may need pro-code extensions. It is therefore important to understand the limitations of a platform before selecting a development approach, so that the chosen approach matches the requirements of the enterprise application.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 417 0 R
